omments":8,"created_at":"2024-11-13T09:37:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T12:03:24Z","closed_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99168","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99168.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99168.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:39Z"},"body":"This changes how false sharing in `SpinLock` is prevented. Formerly, alignment attributes were used. The problem with that is objects containing `SpinLock`s could be allocated in a way that the alignment is not honored, leading to crashes.\r\n\r\nThis PR also applies the new approach to the Apple implementation.\r\n\r\nThis approach could be refactored into a more general one that we may want to use in other sync primitives. However, the point is now to fix the only case we have at the moment.\r\n\r\nFixes crashes stated in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/85167#issuecomment-2468695017.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:*\r\n- Fixes #100163.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/pri